.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-billable-metrics-evaluate-expression - Evaluate an expression for a billable metric


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago billable-metrics evaluate-expression [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Evaluate an expression for a billable metric creation by providing the expression and test data


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--code\fP=""
	The code that identifies a targeted billable metric.

.PP
\fB--expression\fP=""
	Expression used to calculate the event units. The expression is evalutated for each event and the result is then used to calculate the total aggregated units.
Accepted function are 'ceil', 'concat' and 'round' as well as '+', '-', '\\' and '*' operations.
Round is accepting an optional second parameter to specify the number of decimal.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for evaluate-expression

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
	Complete JSON request body or @file.json

.PP
\fB--properties\fP=""
	This field represents additional properties associated with the event. They can be used when evaluating the expression.

.PP
\fB--timestamp\fP=""
	This field captures the Unix timestamp in seconds indicating the occurrence of the event in Coordinated Universal Time (UTC).
If this timestamp is not provided, the API will automatically set it to the time of event reception.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	Override the Lago API key

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Override the Lago API URL

.PP
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	Confirm a dangerous operation with its resource identifier

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Print mutating requests without sending them

.PP
\fB--insecure\fP[=false]
	Allow insecure HTTP or TLS for self-hosted Lago

.PP
\fB--mode\fP=""
	Environment mode: live or test

.PP
\fB--no-retry\fP[=false]
	Disable automatic retries

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="table"
	Output format: table, json, or yaml

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Named profile to use

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath expression applied to the response

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30s
	Total request timeout

.PP
\fB--timing\fP[=false]
	Print request latency breakdown

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Print redacted request and response details


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  lago billable-metrics evaluate-expression --input @payload.json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlago-billable-metrics(1)\fP
